Hokeka Edge — Client Distribution Terms
=======================================

Copyright (c) Hokeka. All rights reserved.

This repository distributes pre-built Hokeka Edge Node binaries and install
scripts for authorised Payment Service Provider (PSP) and bank customers.

1. License grant
   Subject to a valid commercial agreement with Hokeka (or an authorised
   reseller), you may download, install, and run the Edge Node software on
   systems you control for the purpose of evaluating payment transactions for
   your organisation.

2. Restrictions
   You may not: (a) redistribute Edge binaries or install scripts except to
   operators inside your organisation; (b) reverse engineer, decompile, or
   attempt to extract source code except to the extent mandatory law allows;
   (c) use the software to provide a competing hosted AML/fraud service;
   (d) remove or obscure proprietary notices.

3. No source code
   Source code for Hokeka Edge and the Control Plane is not licensed under
   this file and is not published in this repository.

4. Data residency
   Transaction data evaluated by an Edge Node remains on systems you control,
   subject to the Hokeka Edge Data Residency Contract and your Console
   configuration (retention, support access, cross-PSP opt-in).

5. Warranty disclaimer
   THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED “AS IS”, WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
   IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,
   FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NONINFRINGEMENT.

6. Limitation of liability
   TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, HOKEKA SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY
   INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, OR ANY
   LOSS OF PROFITS OR DATA, ARISING FROM USE OF THE SOFTWARE.

7. Termination
   Your rights under this file end automatically if you breach these terms or
   when your commercial agreement with Hokeka ends. On termination you must
   stop using the software and delete copies you control, except records you
   are legally required to retain.

8. Governing terms
   If your signed agreement with Hokeka conflicts with this file, the signed
   agreement controls.

For support, contact your Hokeka account team or use the Console Help menu.
